@baseUrl = http://localhost:5254/api/v1/CaseExecutor
@token = replace-with-case-executor-jwt
@serviceIdOrCode = SVC-2026-0448
@stageId = 1
@documentId = 1

### Assigned services with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/services?search=SVC-2026-0448&status=InProgress&mode=Multimodal&riskChannel=Green&sortBy=updatedAt&sortOrder=desc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Export filtered assigned services as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/export?search=SVC-2026-0448&status=InProgress&mode=Multimodal&sortBy=eta&sortOrder=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service workspace by numeric ID or service code
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save draft, advance, or block a stage
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/stages/{{stageId}}/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stageId": {{stageId}},
  "action": "draft",
  "stageStatus": "InProgress",
  "riskChannel": "Green",
  "stageNote": "Documents checked; awaiting carrier confirmation."
}

### Upload stage document (replace the file reference with a local PDF/JPG/PNG/XLSX)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/stages/{{stageId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CaseExecutorBoundary

--CaseExecutorBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

Commercial invoice
--CaseExecutorBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="commercial-invoice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./commercial-invoice.pdf
--CaseExecutorBoundary--

### Download a stage document
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/stages/{{stageId}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List stage discussions
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/stages/{{stageId}}/discussions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a stage discussion
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/stages/{{stageId}}/discussions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The importer confirmed the invoice details."
}

### List assigned-service documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get risk and compliance guidance
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/risk-compliance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get service activity
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get service categories and workflow sizes
GET {{baseUrl}}/ServiceCategories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Escalate an assigned service
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/escalate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The shipment is at risk of missing its clearance deadline.",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Notify importer (in-app notification and email when an address is available)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/notify-importer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Service update",
  "message": "Your shipment has moved to the inspection stage."
}

### Message importer
POST {{baseUrl}}/services/{{serviceIdOrCode}}/message-importer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Information request",
  "message": "Please confirm the consignee contact details."
}
